Package: AdaStableNet
Title: Adaptive Eigenvalue-Based Estimation of Linear ODE Systems
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Ricardo J.", "Lopez Candelaria", 
                  email = "rlopez.research@gmail.com", 
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates constant system matrices in autonomous linear ordinary
    differential equations from noisy multivariate trajectories. A functional
    data estimate initializes a profiled nonlinear least-squares fit in a real
    modal basis. Unconstrained, Wald-thresholded, and stability-constrained
    estimates are provided together with prediction, diagnostics, approximate
    coefficient inference, and simulation utilities.
